{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1000_p", "source_sha256": "32d5b3a1edf1a484b570084259e0ce99065915f91853b88db4972864ba0db333", "ja": "（今日の撮影は、アイドル達が出演する時代劇。\nさて、もうじきリハ―サルが始まるけど……）", "zh": "（今天拍摄的是偶像们出演的时代剧。好了，马上就要开始排练了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b1d58de447d2a77924782830c21374bc2ccdf7746f65d53f001d4973924b017c", "ja": "うぅ……やっぱり難しいなぁ……。\nどうしよう、もうリハーサルなのに……。", "zh": "呜呜……果然好难啊……\n怎么办，马上就要彩排了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0c11a40b297710061a54ea980356659657d385b3e9c5938ef8eedbb82b7c9dc6", "ja": "風花、どうした？　何か悩んでるのか？", "zh": "风花，怎么了？是在烦恼什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "158385ea04e05c4e5bff6a68a641cd8c31f20e62d037f458982ed701fc5ca529", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nそれが、私……殺陣が上手にできなくて。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n那个，我……不太会练好武打动作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "86933df59772d3d67d80cb5a4316fe848aaa52af328cc9baf6ad394952bf720a", "ja": "剣豪役ですから、刀を早く、\n力強く振らないと、迫力が出ませんよね？", "zh": "因为演的是剑豪，所以刀要挥得又快又有力，不然就没有气势了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "48fd6a34b782bbcb5c4f44ba03eeb8b591b336a958d6e2b26422f227acb7c819", "ja": "でも、もし当たっちゃったらって思ったら、\n思いっきり振れなくて……うぅ。", "zh": "可是，一想到万一真的打中了对方，\n就没法用尽全力挥刀……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1006_p", "source_sha256": "31aec5f7154ef7c51831607b8fdb9010e86349ec1b25879291044cd156128b33", "ja": "まあ、相手もプロだし、大丈夫だとは思うけど……。\nそれより、大事なのは雰囲気じゃないか？", "zh": "不过，对手也是专业人士，我想应该没问题……  \n比起这个，更重要的不应该是气氛吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6237c00cb159fb28b2bcd63ce949a9a0009e28780e14c9b9b1f92f3883dcf17c", "ja": "達人って、気迫で相手を圧倒したりするらしいし。\n剣を振る前後の雰囲気で、演出してみたらどうだろう？", "zh": "听说高手会用气势压倒对手。要不在挥剑前后营造一下气氛，试着演出来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "41a527b2e1df5d5d2b6053bc196c7bf5fabc88a9915b436ea23c26c5e2b884ad", "ja": "なるほど、雰囲気……それなら、\n剣を振るよりは、なんとかなるかも？", "zh": "原来如此，氛围感……这样的话，\n或许比起挥剑，会更容易做到一些？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6022ca00894bd5f5b04d01e1d2c24e6e5282fad8a310427f062d90e96f7595e0", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\n私、なんとかやってみますね。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生！\n我会想办法试试看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0272_1010_p", "source_sha256": "57768fdcaee2b3da9eef065adde794b0bf98e379f7b91f8df8cf16478412f9df", "ja": "（その後の撮影で、風花は見事に殺陣を\nこなしてくれた……迫力のある映像に仕上がったぞ！）", "zh": "（在那之后的拍摄中，风花出色地完成了武打动作……最终拍成了充满魄力的影像！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
